  "description": "A System.Text.Json library for declarative requirement and emptiness validation over the contract model: a property required only when a sibling holds a given value, and a property required to be present and non-empty, both enforced during deserialization.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "ktsu.JsonRequiredConditionally",
