  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## v1.2.31 (patch)\n\nChanges since v1.2.30:\n\n- Validate the entries of a generic-only dictionary under a claimed holder [patch] (#109) (matt-edmondson)\n- Compare a float and a double sibling constant at float precision [patch] (#113) (matt-edmondson)\n- Pair a sorted dictionary's keys through its order-only comparer [patch] (#105) (matt-edmondson)\n- Widen only numbers to numbers when matching a sibling [patch] (#104) (matt-edmondson)\n- Refuse a null constant against a non-nullable value-type sibling [patch] (#103) (matt-edmondson)\n- Validate the key and value of a KeyValuePair member (Claude)",
